      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FREDIDRIVSAMERCURY (2) overcame a wide run for a dominant win in the QBred 3YO Trotting Final two back then drew on the second row and raced parked when runner-up last time. Won the only time he attempted this shorter distance and looks tough to stop from the good draw. MAJESTIC LAVROS NZ (4) makes his first appearance since tackling the Inter Dominion series in July. Three-time fresh winner who draws well and was readied with a trial placing. Hard to knock the consistency of DARCYS FIREBALL (6) who added to a string of wins and placings when he finished second here on Friday. NELLIE JOY (8) draws for a trail and is worth including.",
